/Title (Conclusion: The terminal and Selenium outputs confirmed that the exception was handled without uncontrolled program termination. Ilearned how save_screenshot\(\) provides evidence and how try, except, and finally can provide controlled error handling and browser cleanup. The firstscreenshot was saved and the missing-element error was caught by the except block. Asecond screenshot was then saved for the error state. The finally block closed the browser, so the program finished cleanly even though an exception occurred.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 732 0 R
/Next 654 0 R
>>
